# ============================================
# Petra Risk Assessment - Environment Variables
# ============================================

# --------------------------------------------
# Postmark Email Configuration (REQUIRED)
# --------------------------------------------

# Postmark server API token
# Get this from: https://account.postmarkapp.com/servers
POSTMARK_SERVER_TOKEN=your-postmark-server-token-here

# Sender email address (must be verified in Postmark)
# This is the "From" address for all emails sent by the app
# IMPORTANT: This email address must be verified in your Postmark account
# For production: Use a verified domain email (e.g., risk@yourdomain.com)
# For testing: Use a Postmark sandbox email or verified address
POSTMARK_FROM=risk@yourdomain.com

# Advisor notification email address
# This is where assessment results are sent for internal review
# Can be the same as POSTMARK_FROM or a different email address
ADVISOR_EMAIL=risk@yourdomain.com

# --------------------------------------------
# URL Configuration (OPTIONAL)
# --------------------------------------------

# Base URL for the application
# Used for email assets (logo, images) and callbacks
# Priority: BASE_URL > SITE_URL > VERCEL_URL (auto-set by Vercel)
#
# If not set, the app will automatically use:
# 1. VERCEL_URL (automatically provided by Vercel in production)
# 2. Fallback to: https://petra-risk-app.vercel.app
#
# Only set this if you want to override the automatic URL detection
# Examples:
#   BASE_URL=https://risk.petrafinancial.com (when custom domain is ready)
#   BASE_URL=https://your-vercel-app.vercel.app
# BASE_URL=

# Alternative to BASE_URL (for compatibility)
# SITE_URL=

# --------------------------------------------
# Optional: Vercel KV Storage
# --------------------------------------------

# Vercel KV REST API endpoint (for storing assessment data)
# Automatically provided by Vercel when KV is enabled
# KV_REST_API_URL=

# Vercel KV REST API token
# Automatically provided by Vercel when KV is enabled
# KV_REST_API_TOKEN=

# ============================================
# MIGRATION NOTES
# ============================================
#
# When custom domain (risk.petrafinancial.com) is restored:
# 1. Update BASE_URL to: https://risk.petrafinancial.com
# 2. Update POSTMARK_FROM to: risk@petrafinancial.com (if desired)
# 3. Verify domain in Postmark settings
# 4. No code changes required - just update environment variables!
#
# For Postmark domain verification:
# - Add DNS records provided by Postmark for sender domain
# - Verify DKIM, SPF, and Return-Path records
# - See: https://postmarkapp.com/support/article/1046-how-do-i-verify-a-domain
